# Witness for EpochMeetsCoreOwnAlloc. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - an own stamped append - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: EpochMeetsCoreOwnAllocWitness
TARGET: EpochMeetsCoreOwnAlloc
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an own stamped append is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("EpochMeetsCoreOwnAlloc", COwnAlloc(a))
--- REPLACE
Fails("EpochMeetsCoreOwnAlloc", FALSE)
--- END
